      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，『横梁压床』是指，\n在睡眠中会无意识地压迫心灵的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b96ff6de6689ce8850e10e2823844b142b8547729c7d354f341af6a2b924436",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
